```json
{
  "family": "payment-service",
  "networkMode": "awsvpc",
  "requiresCompatibilities": ["FARGATE"],
  "cpu": "1024",
  "memory": "2048",
  "ephemeralStorage": { "sizeInGiB": 30 },
  "runtimePlatform": {
    "operatingSystemFamily": "LINUX",
    "cpuArchitecture": "ARM64"
  },
  "executionRoleArn": "arn:aws:iam::123:role/ecsTaskExecutionRole",
  "taskRoleArn": "arn:aws:iam::123:role/paymentServiceTaskRole",
  "containerDefinitions": [{
    "name": "app",
    "image": "123.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/payment-service:v1.2.3",
    "essential": true,
    "portMappings": [{ "containerPort": 8080, "protocol": "tcp" }],
    "environment": [
      { "name": "SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE", "value": "production" },
      { "name": "JAVA_OPTS", "value": "-XX:MaxRAMPercentage=75 -XX:+UseG1GC" }
    ],
    "secrets": [
      { "name": "DB_PASSWORD", "valueFrom": "arn:aws:secretsmanager:us-east-1:123:secret:payment-db-password-xyz:password::" },
      { "name": "STRIPE_API_KEY", "valueFrom": "arn:aws:secretsmanager:us-east-1:123:secret:stripe-key-abc" }
    ],
    "healthCheck": {
      "command": ["CMD-SHELL", "curl -f http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/liveness || exit 1"],
      "interval": 30,
      "timeout": 5,
      "retries": 3,
      "startPeriod": 60
    },
    "stopTimeout": 30,
    "logConfiguration": {
      "logDriver": "awslogs",
      "options": {
        "awslogs-group": "/ecs/payment-service",
        "awslogs-region": "us-east-1",
        "awslogs-stream-prefix": "app",
        "awslogs-create-group": "true"
      }
    },
    "ulimits": [{ "name": "nofile", "softLimit": 65536, "hardLimit": 65536 }]
  }]
}
```

**Field-by-field:**

- **`networkMode: awsvpc`** — mandatory for Fargate; each task gets its own ENI and IP; required for Security Group per task
- **`cpu`/`memory`** — Fargate has fixed valid combos (1024/2048, 2048/4096, etc.); mismatched values fail at launch
- **`ephemeralStorage`** — default 20GiB scratch; increase to 30–200GiB for containers that need more temp space
- **`runtimePlatform.cpuArchitecture: ARM64`** — Graviton for 20% cheaper; most Java apps work on ARM (Temurin/Corretto have ARM builds)
- **`executionRoleArn`** — ECS agent uses this to pull ECR images, read secrets, write logs; standard role
- **`taskRoleArn`** — the application's IAM role; used by AWS SDK calls inside the container; per-service least privilege
- **`secrets`** from Secrets Manager/SSM — ECS injects as env var at start; secret value never in the task def
- **`healthCheck`** — container-level probe; failure triggers ECS to kill and restart; `startPeriod` gives Spring Boot time to boot
- **`stopTimeout: 30`** — on deploy/scale-down, ECS sends SIGTERM and waits 30s for graceful shutdown before SIGKILL
- **`logConfiguration`** — awslogs ships to CloudWatch; use firelens for third-party (Datadog, Splunk)
- **`ulimits`** — file descriptor limit; raise for high-connection workloads (avoid EMFILE)

**Corresponding service definition** (separate from task def):

```json
{
  "serviceName": "payment-service",
  "taskDefinition": "payment-service:42",
  "desiredCount": 4,
  "capacityProviderStrategy": [
    { "capacityProvider": "FARGATE", "weight": 1, "base": 2 },
    { "capacityProvider": "FARGATE_SPOT", "weight": 3 }
  ],
  "deploymentConfiguration": {
    "minimumHealthyPercent": 100,
    "maximumPercent": 200,
    "deploymentCircuitBreaker": { "enable": true, "rollback": true }
  },
  "loadBalancers": [{
    "targetGroupArn": "arn:aws:...",
    "containerName": "app",
    "containerPort": 8080
  }],
  "healthCheckGracePeriodSeconds": 120
}
```
